WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.713
Now apply the plan to the fake, twice.

2
00:00:02.713 --> 00:00:06.590
The first run sends four requests,
and the second sends none,

3
00:00:06.590 --> 00:00:11.734
because everything already matches; and
every workload policy is report-only,

4
00:00:11.734 --> 00:00:14.662
while an unrelated user
policy is untouched.

5
00:00:14.662 --> 00:00:16.412
Then try to enforce Ring 1.

6
00:00:16.412 --> 00:00:19.084
Record the decision
and the summary's hash,

7
00:00:19.084 --> 00:00:23.663
and plan without the enforcement switch:
the ring is held, with the reason.

8
00:00:23.663 --> 00:00:27.556
Add the switch and the summary,
and the location policy turns on,

9
00:00:27.556 --> 00:00:30.851
while the brand-new risk
policy waits for the next run.

10
00:00:30.851 --> 00:00:33.890
Change one byte of the
summary, and it's held again.
